      <title>代码免费后调试成了新瓶颈：Vibe Coding 正在削弱开发者能力</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai002/post/20260904/%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E5%85%8D%E8%B4%B9%E5%90%8E%E8%B0%83%E8%AF%95%E6%88%90%E4%BA%86%E6%96%B0%E7%93%B6%E9%A2%88Vibe-Coding-%E6%AD%A3%E5%9C%A8%E5%89%8A%E5%BC%B1%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E8%80%85%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B/</link>
